      {
        "name": "profile",
        "description": "Quality profiles (quality.yml).",
        "commands": [
          {
            "name": "validate",
            "description": "Validate a quality profile against the bundled JSON Schema and compile its regexes.\n\nFollows `extends` (each base is validated too; a cycle is an error). Any\nunknown key, at any level, is an error. Both kinds validate: article\n(check/fix) and meta (antagor seo-meta). Exit 0: valid — prints kind and\nfingerprint (first 8 hex of sha1 of the profile and its bases). Exit 2:\nINVALID_PROFILE with the path to the key and what is wrong.\n\nExample: textcheck profile validate content-logistics.quality.yml --json",
            "options": [
              {
                "name": "--json",
                "description": "Emit machine-readable JSON output.",
                "metadata": [
                  {
                    "name": "x-rb-type",
                    "value": "boolean"
